pause "Windows Sandbox is ready with C:\\M5Kit read-only and C:\\M5Outbox writable? Press Enter for the bare-machine installer check (stage 2)."

# ── 2 ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
stage "Bare machine: install recorder, first run, helper, and HID fallback"
say "Work only inside Windows Sandbox. Do not close it until stage 6 says the mapped evidence is validated. Closing Sandbox permanently discards anything not copied to C:\\M5Outbox."
say "00-confirm-run already proved that the read-only installer is hash-identical to the host release artifact and carries Mark-of-the-Web ZoneId=3. The required unsigned-installer gate is SmartScreen reputation, not elevation."
