record_check SMARTSCREEN_REPUTATION_OK "Did Windows SmartScreen specifically show 'Windows protected your PC', and did More info expose Run anyway?" "Retry the ZoneId=3 installer from C:\\M5Kit. If this exact SmartScreen sequence still does not show, record failure. A UAC prompt, if Windows shows one, cannot satisfy this reputation gate."
require_screenshot 'smartscreen-reputation' "the expanded Windows SmartScreen 'Windows protected your PC' reputation dialog with Run anyway visible" SMARTSCREEN_SCREENSHOT_OK
step "On the expanded SmartScreen reputation dialog choose Run anyway to enter the assisted installer. This explicit Windows protected your PC → More info → Run anyway sequence is the required SmartScreen observation."
note "The installer runs asInvoker and defaults to a current-user install, so the normal path does not show UAC. If an install-mode page offers All Users, keep the current-user/Only for me choice; do not select All Users merely to provoke elevation. If Windows nevertheless shows UAC, treat it as optional system behavior, not SmartScreen or required evidence, and continue only if you are comfortable approving it."
step "In the assisted installer, keep the intended current-user install, confirm the destination page offers a directory choice, keep the default per-user directory or deliberately choose another per-user directory and note it, continue Install, and leave Run Playtest Recorder selected."
record_check INSTALL_DIR_OK "Did the installer offer an install-directory choice and install into the selected directory?" "Run the installer again and verify the destination chooser; do not guess from the final path."
step "On first launch, confirm First-run setup opens. On the Detect OBS step choose Detect OBS before installing OBS; it must report not found."
record_check FIRST_RUN_OK "Did the fresh installed app automatically open its first-run setup wizard?" "Close the app, uninstall/reinstall within Sandbox if necessary, and launch from the Start menu to retry with fresh Sandbox state."
record_check OBS_NOT_FOUND_OK "Before OBS was installed, did Detect OBS clearly report OBS not found?" "Retry Detect OBS while the Sandbox is still bare. If OBS was already installed, this negative observation requires a fresh Sandbox rerun."
require_screenshot 'first-run-obs-not-found' "the recorder first-run wizard with the OBS-not-found result" FIRST_RUN_SCREENSHOT_OK
